{"id":"imfiglxuixrkncc9ltwngqd4i","title":"中药现代故事：时光慢慢走，留下我的回眸","originalTitle":"《中药现代故事》后记：时光啊，慢慢走，留下我的回眸","summary":"这本书记录了中药从传统到现代研究的漫长过程，强调了时间在药物开发中的重要性。每一个故事都展示了药物在不同时间尺度上的变化，以及在研究过程中需要耐心等待和反复验证。作者呼吁继续回眸那些尚未被充分研究的工作，推动中药现代化的进程。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=279293&do=blog&id=1561516"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T05:30:48.556Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T05:30:48.556Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":19,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}